# Why do we use modules?

# Modules are useful because they provide:

# Code reusability – write code once and use it many times.
# Better organization – divide a large program into smaller files.
# Easy maintenance – changes can be made in a particular module.
# Avoid repetition – common functions can be kept in one module.
# Better readability – code becomes easier to understand.